(text "The console end of key-c (hardware/key-pcb/PROPOSALS.md):\n- VKEY comes through U2: 80 mA limit, reverse blocking,\n  discharged when off. Never straight from a GPIO.\n- CC1 and CC2 read on their own ADC pins. Plugged\n  straight in, a key shows 5.1k on both.\n- 2.2k pull-ups to VKEY, so a key that's off isn't\n  powered through SDA/SCL.\n- U3/U4 rails on 3V3: the CC pull-ups can't feed VKEY." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 139.7 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f464438b-2853-415b-8c1a-6d2276f69964"))
